            <ArticleTitle>[Historical Overview of the Clinical Development of the Small Incision Lenticule Extraction Surgery (SMILE)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>117-122</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1055/s-0042-115944</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The clinical use of femtosecond lasers has led to significant progress in the quality of refractive surgery. SMILE femtosecond laser surgery (SMILE: Small Incision Lenticule Extraction) permits the first one step intrastromal laser procedure without a flap. This article describes the gradual development of this surgery during the last ten years.</AbstractText>
